GoldenrodCity_Text_Beauty:
	.string "这里是满金道馆！\p馆主小茜现在不在馆里。\n她可能去\l播音塔那边了。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_Woman:
	.string "我以前在小茜的道馆里修行，\n可她老是哭，\l哭得我头疼。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_HikerDay:
	.string "我进游戏城的时候\n还是晚上……我到底\l在里面待了多久？！$"
	.string ""
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_HikerNight:
	.string "我进游戏城的时候\n还是白天……我到底\l在里面待了多久？！$"
	.string ""
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_Snubbull:
	.string "差不多娃娃：呜嘀嘀——！$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_MrMime:
	.string "............................$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_ElmCall:
	.string "空木博士：喂，是{PLAYER}吗？\n那颗蛋孵出来了吗？\p孵出来以后，别忘了\n带来研究所给我看看！我\l一定要亲眼瞧瞧！$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_PokefanM:
	.string "为了替换那座吱呀作响的旧塔，\n他们建起了新的播音塔。$"
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_Youngster1:
	.string "听说新开了一家自行车店，\n可我怎么也找不到。$"
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_CooltrainerF1:
	.string "那个穿黑衣服的人，\n打扮得像个火箭队成员？\p真是滑稽！$"
	.string ""
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_CooltrainerF1_Cleared:
	.string "那个穿黑衣服的人真的是\n火箭队的人吗？真不敢相信！$"
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_CooltrainerF2:
	.string "满金市的播音塔\n可是这里的地标。\p他们现在正在搞活动。\p只要答对他们的问答，\n就能得到一台崭新的收音机。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_CooltrainerF2_GotCard:
	.string "哦，你的宝可梦装置\n已经能当收音机用了！$"
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_Youngster2:
	.string "嘿、嘿嘿嘿……\p我在百货店的地下室\n玩闹被骂了一顿。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_Lass:
	.string "里面的那个人会评价你\n宝可梦的昵称。\p他还能帮你改名。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_Gramps:
	.string "呼！这城市真大，\n我什么都找不到。$"
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_RocketScout1:
	.string "原来这就是播音塔……$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_RocketScout2:
	.string "干什么，小毛孩？\n快给我滚开！$"
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_Rocket1:
	.string "别挡道！\n滚一边去，小鬼！$"
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_Rocket2:
	.string "接管播音塔……\p什么？这不关你的事！$"
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_Rocket3:
	.string "宝可梦？那不过是\n我们赚钱的工具！$"
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_Rocket4:
	.string "我们的梦想马上就要实现了……\p这一路走来，真是漫长又艰难……$"
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_Rocket5:
	.string "喂，小鬼！\n这里不是你该来的地方！$"
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_Rocket6:
	.string "来尝尝火箭队的\n恐怖滋味吧！$"
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_StationSign:
	.string "满金市车站$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_RadioTowerSign:
	.string "满金市播音塔$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_DeptStoreSign:
	.string "宝可梦商品一应俱全！\p满金市百货店$"
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_GymSign:
	.string "满金市宝可梦道馆\n馆主：小茜\p超级漂亮的大姐姐！$"
	.string ""
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_CitySign:
	.string "满金市\p洋溢华丽魅力的节庆之城$"
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_BikeShopSign:
	.string "世界就是一条自行车道！\n自行车店$"
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_GameCornerSign:
	.string "您的游乐场！\p满金市游戏城$"
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_NameRaterSign:
	.string "姓名鉴定师\p为您评价宝可梦的昵称$"
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_UndergroundNorthSign:
	.string "地下通道入口$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_UndergroundSouthSign:
	.string "地下通道入口$"


GoldenrodCity_Text_FlowerShopSign:
	.string "花开烂漫的花店$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_MoveTutorAsk:
	.string "我能教你的宝可梦\n一些厉害的招式！\p要我教你吗？$"
	.string ""
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_MoveTutorCost:
	.string "要花1000枚代币。\n可以吗？$"
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_MoveTutorDecline:
	.string "唉……可这些招式明明很棒啊！$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_MoveTutorWhich:
	.string "哇哈哈哈！包你不后悔！\p想学哪一招？$"
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_MoveTutorNoCash:
	.string "真可惜。看来我得\n回家拿点钱了……$"
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_MoveTutorUnderstand:
	.string "等你弄懂了这一招，\n就算得上是独当一面的训练家了。$"
	.string ""

GoldenrodCity_Text_MoveTutorFarewell:
	.string "哇哈哈哈！再会了，小鬼！$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_MoveTutorBut:
	.string "可、可是……$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_MoveTutorNotEnoughCoins:
	.string "……您的代币不够啊……$"

Goldenrod_OnFrame:: 
	map_script_2 VAR_RIVAL_STATE, 6, GoldenrodCity_RivalAfterWhitney
	.2byte 0
`

script Goldenrod_Daytime_ExpertM {
	lock
	msgbox("这次我一定要赢你，蒂法妮！\n我们可是整整训练了一星期！")
	closemessage
	playmoncry(SPECIES_STARAVIA, CRY_MODE_NORMAL)
	applymovement(LOCALID_GOLDENROD_STARAVIA, moves(jump_in_place_right*2))
	waitmovement(0)
	release
	end
}
script Goldenrod_Daytime_ExpertF {
	lock
	msgbox("哈！你要是还没把属性相克\n学明白，就永远赢不了我！")
	closemessage
	playmoncry(SPECIES_ELECTABUZZ, CRY_MODE_NORMAL)
	applymovement(LOCALID_GOLDENROD_ELECTABUZZ, moves(jump_in_place_left*2))
	waitmovement(0)
	release
	end
}
script Goldenrod_Daytime_Staravia {
	lock
	playmoncry(SPECIES_STARAVIA, CRY_MODE_NORMAL)
	msgbox("嘎啊！")
	waitmoncry
	release
	end
}
script Goldenrod_Daytime_Electabuzz {
	lock
	playmoncry(SPECIES_ELECTABUZZ, CRY_MODE_NORMAL)
	msgbox("哔哩！")
	waitmoncry
	release
	end
}
script Goldenrod_Daytime_Bystander {
	lock
	faceplayer
	msgbox("那两个人已经较劲了好几周。\n市政府真该给他们专建一座对战场。")
	release
	end

}
script Goldenrod_Nighttime_Burglar {
	lock
	faceplayer
	msgbox("这座城市发展得这么快，\n已经有人开始怀疑\l这么多钱都是从哪儿来的。\p要是他们知道地下每天都\n有多少钱转手，怕是\l连眼珠子都要瞪出来。\p等你再变强一些，\n说不定有一天也会明白的。")
	release
	end
}
script Goldenrod_Nighttime_Oldlady {
	lock
	faceplayer
	if (flag(FLAG_GOLDENROD_SMACKDOWN)) {
		msgbox("击落能让任何目标落到地上。\n对付飞行属性的\l宝可梦也很有用。")
		release
		end
	}
	msgbox("有个小偷想在昏暗的小巷里打劫我，\n他可没想到我会用一记漂亮的\l一本背负投把他击落在地。\p来，这个你也\n拿去试试吧。")
	giveitem(ITEM_TM_SMACK_DOWN)
	setflag(FLAG_GOLDENROD_SMACKDOWN)
	msgbox("击落能让任何目标落到地上。\n对付飞行属性的\l宝可梦也很有用。")
	release
	end
}


script GoldenrodCity_OnTransition {
	call(Common_EventScript_SetupRivalGfxId)
	setflag(FLAG_HIDE_GOLDENROD_RIVAL)
	if (var(VAR_RIVAL_STATE) == 6 && flag(FLAG_DEFEATED_GOLDENROD_CITY_GYM)) {
		clearflag(FLAG_HIDE_GOLDENROD_RIVAL)
	}
	end
}

script GoldenrodCity_RivalAfterWhitney {
	if (var(VAR_RIVAL_STATE) == 6 && flag(FLAG_DEFEATED_GOLDENROD_CITY_GYM)) { 
		lock
		playse(SE_PIN)
		applymovement(LOCALID_GOLDENROD_RIVAL, Common_Movement_ExclamationMark)
		waitmovement(0)
		delay(30)
		playbgm(MUS_HG_LYRA, TRUE)
		createfieldmugshotrival
		msgbox("嘿，{PLAYER}！\n和小茜的对战怎么样了？\p她那头大奶罐可是\n三两下就把我的队伍打垮了！")
		msgbox("哦，你已经拿到徽章了……\p恭喜你。\p又一场轻松的胜利，是吧？\n还是一如既往啊。")
		msgbox("嘿，要不要一起去\n缘朱市？\p算了，还是当没说过吧。你多半\n还想多抓些宝可梦，我就\l先去看看我的爷爷奶奶好了。\p那么，回见！")
		removefieldmugshot
		closemessage
		applymovement(LOCALID_GOLDENROD_RIVAL, moves(walk_left*4, walk_down*6))
		waitmovement(0)
		setvar(VAR_RIVAL_STATE, 7)
		setflag(FLAG_HIDE_GOLDENROD_RIVAL)
		removeobject(LOCALID_GOLDENROD_RIVAL)
		savebgm(MUS_DUMMY)
		fadedefaultbgm
		release
	}
	end
}
